cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "When do single-cell response distributions improve drug retrieval?"
abstract: >-
  Code, analyses and manuscript materials for studying when single-cell response
  populations improve intervention retrieval beyond mean responses. PopRetrieve
  compares direction-only mean cosine, magnitude-aware mean L2 and population-level
  retrieval scores, then evaluates whether information beyond response magnitude
  changes candidate ordering and survives forward prediction.
